lib/doc/ - library manual page
==============================

    libcgra.3    section-3 man page for the whole libcgra API. Hand-written
                 groff -man (no doxygen). Mirrors include/cgra.h.

Build / read
------------
    make -f lib.mk man                 # lint + render to build/libcgra.3.txt
    man ./libcgra.3                    # read it directly
    groff -man -Tutf8 libcgra.3 | less

Install
-------
    install -Dm644 libcgra.3 /usr/local/share/man/man3/libcgra.3

See also: cgra(1) and cgra(5) in sw/doc/.
